Someone posted a suggestion for a 'wand of storm' recently,
a 'wand of flood' might be a little easier to accomodate.
It could behave like a weak wand of striking on most monsters, but
neutralise dragons, drown purple worms, and have a side effect
using the 'fountain overflows' algorithm. - and, of course it would
extinguish fire if you've got that in yet..

Adding more wands like this doesn't make the game any easier, there's
more to learn and a limit to what you can carry. It does add a little
fresh interest though.

Also, how's about a 'lucky charm'? Lots of ways that could be
implemented.

Don't make it too hard, I've had several very good games, but never
seen the amulet yet.

